# Build context for .oss-scanner/Dockerfile. Docker prefers this file over the
# .dockerignore at the repository root, which is written for the release image
# and leaves out the tests, the documentation and the deployment/ folder. The
# scanner needs all of them, and the CLI build reads deployment/.
#
# A fresh clone, as the scanner makes it, has none of the entries below. They
# only keep local build output and secrets out of a build from a working copy.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.angular
tmp
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
!**/.env.*.example
**/*.db
